  "legacy/04-01": {
    "id": "legacy/04-01",
    "code": "04-01",
    "marker": "STOP",
    "front": "STOP\nDraw this card just before you set up your first game in April.",
    "back": "REPORT:\nTRANSMISSION METHOD\n\"The eggheads are lookin' to figure out how the Soviets plan to deploy MEDUSA. You've been out in the field; can you give them some direction?\"\nCheck one box and place this card in your Intelligence file:\nTransmission Method:\nAirborne\nAnimal Contact\nSaliva\nWaterborne",
    "frontFlavor": "",
    "backFlavor": "\"The eggheads are lookin' to figure out how the Soviets plan to deploy MEDUSA. You've been out in the field; can you give them some direction?\""
  },
  "legacy/04-02": {
    "id": "legacy/04-02",
    "code": "04-02",
    "marker": "continue",
    "front": "MISSION BRIEFING\n\"No news on Sabik, but the Reds'll keep us plenty busy. They're buildin' something in Europe; their chatter is callin' it a ‘control center.’ We want to know what it's for, so figure out where it's bein' built and send a team to bug it.\nThere's another MEDUSA trial as well; try to help as many cities as you can.\"\nOPEN\n0007\nand read its contents.",
    "back": "",
    "frontFlavor": "\"No news on Sabik, but the Reds'll keep us plenty busy. They're buildin' something in Europe; their chatter is callin' it a ‘control center.’ We want to know what it's for, so figure out where it's bein' built and send a team to bug it.\nThere's another MEDUSA trial as well; try to help as many cities as you can.\"",
    "backFlavor": ""
  },
  "legacy/04-03": {
    "id": "legacy/04-03",
    "code": "04-03",
    "marker": "continue",
    "front": "MEDUSA'S EFFECTS\n\"We're startin' to learn more about the MEDUSA plague; it's highly contagious, and every new strain they cook up is gonna get worse.\nThe lab says it causes 'mild paralysis of several autonomous functions,' so breathing, muscle coordination, and the like are affected. The treatment we have is only really good at slowin' the spread of it, so try to avoid exposure. I need my agents to stay healthy out there.\"\nRight Now\nOpen the following doors:\nH 29 J 40\nThen add the Symptom and Infection cards to the reserve.",
    "back": "",
    "frontFlavor": "\"We're startin' to learn more about the MEDUSA plague; it's highly contagious, and every new strain they cook up is gonna get worse.\nThe lab says it causes 'mild paralysis of several autonomous functions,' so breathing, muscle coordination, and the like are affected. The treatment we have is only really good at slowin' the spread of it, so try to avoid exposure. I need my agents to stay healthy out there.\"",
    "backFlavor": ""
  },
