    "code": "04-19",
    "marker": "continue",
    "front": "This is a disrupt trial objective.\n\nTo set it up, separate the 5 South America City cards from the Player deck, shuffle them, and place 3 of them faceup into the Operations area. These are the 3 trial cities.\n\nThen, shuffle the remaining South America cards back into the Player deck.\n\nFinally, flip this card over and place it on top of the 3 trial City cards.",
    "back": "APRIL OBJECTIVE 1\n\nDISRUPT THE SECOND TRIAL\n\nDisrupt Trial in:\n1, 2, OR 3 KNOWN CITIES IN SOUTH AMERICA AT THE SAME TIME\n\nCompleted: Read Debrief 224\nFailed: Read Debrief 156",
