    "back": "APRIL OBJECTIVE 2\n\nBUG CONTROL CENTER\n\nAcquire Target in:\n1 UNKNOWN CITY IN EUROPE\n\nCompleted: Read Debrief 165\nFailed: Read Debrief 193",
    "frontFlavor": "",
