  "legacy/05-01": {
    "id": "legacy/05-01",
    "code": "05-01",
    "marker": "STOP",
    "front": "STOP\n\nDraw this card just before you set up your first game in May.",
    "back": "UPDATE\n\n\"Greetings agents. I am Dr. Helen Morris. You may call me Dr. Morris, and I bring tragic news. Former Agent Charles Sabik raided this facility last night to steal data, weaponry, and other key items. During this raid, several individuals were killed, including your CMO, John Cooper.\"\n\nIf the Discretionary Budget card is in the reserve, destroy it.\n\n\"I will admit that John Cooper and I rarely saw eye to eye. His disregard for protocol resulted in numerous mistakes over the years, but he remained a deeply loyal and dedicated agent. He will be missed.\"",
    "frontFlavor": "",
    "backFlavor": "\"Greetings agents. I am Dr. Helen Morris. You may call me Dr. Morris, and I bring tragic news. Former Agent Charles Sabik raided this facility last night to steal data, weaponry, and other key items. During this raid, several individuals were killed, including your CMO, John Cooper.\"\n\n\"I will admit that John Cooper and I rarely saw eye to eye. His disregard for protocol resulted in numerous mistakes over the years, but he remained a deeply loyal and dedicated agent. He will be missed.\""
  },
  "legacy/05-02": {
    "id": "legacy/05-02",
    "code": "05-02",
    "marker": "continue",
    "front": "MISSION BRIEFING\n\n\"This operation and your continued development falls to me. Be aware that I have high expectations.\n\nYou now have three objectives; events are accelerating, and we must adapt. First, MEDUSA research materials are being smuggled out of Johannesburg. Second, Sabik must be brought to heel; he plans to use the materials he stole from Langley in an operation near Istanbul and Peking. Third, the Soviets are building another control center.\"\n\nOPEN 0004 and read its contents.",
    "back": "",
    "frontFlavor": "\"This operation and your continued development falls to me. Be aware that I have high expectations.\n\nYou now have three objectives; events are accelerating, and we must adapt. First, MEDUSA research materials are being smuggled out of Johannesburg. Second, Sabik must be brought to heel; he plans to use the materials he stole from Langley in an operation near Istanbul and Peking. Third, the Soviets are building another control center.\"",
    "backFlavor": ""
  },
  "legacy/05-03": {
    "id": "legacy/05-03",
    "code": "05-03",
    "marker": "continue",
    "front": "This is a pursuit objective.\n\nTo set it up, place a Pursuit token in Johannesburg.\n\nThen, place this card onto the board in the Operations area and flip it over.",
    "back": "MAY OBJECTIVE 1\n\nINTERRUPT THE SOVIET DELIVERY\n\nRemove the last Pursuit token from the board\n\nSTARTING CITY: JOHANNESBURG\nDESTINATION: ANY SOVIET CITY\n\nCompleted: Read Debrief 146\nFailed (First half of month): Read Debrief 202\nFailed (Second half of month): Read Debrief 148",
    "frontFlavor": "",
    "backFlavor": ""
  },
  "legacy/05-04": {
    "id": "legacy/05-04",
    "code": "05-04",
    "marker": "continue",
    "front": "This objective has 2 known target cities.\nFlip this card over and place it onto the board in the Operations area.",
    "back": "MAY OBJECTIVE 2\nFIND SABIK'S OPERATIVES\nAcquire Target in 2 Cities with the same action:\nISTANBUL\nPEKING\nCompleted: Read Debrief 223\nFailed: Read Debrief 159",
    "frontFlavor": "",
    "backFlavor": ""
  },
