    "back": "MAY OBJECTIVE 3\nBUG CONTROL CENTER\nAcquire Target in:\n1 UNKNOWN CITY IN SOUTH AMERICA\nCompleted: Read Debrief 167\nFailed: Read Debrief 136",
    "frontFlavor": "",
    "backFlavor": ""
