  "legacy/09-01": {
    "id": "legacy/09-01",
    "code": "09-01",
    "marker": "STOP",
    "front": "STOP\n\nDraw this card just before you set up your first game in September.",
    "back": "MISSION BRIEFING\n\n“The Soviets are developing and manufacturing the MEDUSA plague at a facility called PEARL Compound, near Lake Baikal: the same location where Agent Sabik was held last year.\n\nExpect to infiltrate PEARL repeatedly in the coming months. Your first task is to find records of Sabik’s captivity. Discover what broke him.”\n\nOPEN\n0003\nand read its contents.",
    "frontFlavor": "",
    "backFlavor": "“The Soviets are developing and manufacturing the MEDUSA plague at a facility called PEARL Compound, near Lake Baikal: the same location where Agent Sabik was held last year.\n\nExpect to infiltrate PEARL repeatedly in the coming months. Your first task is to find records of Sabik’s captivity. Discover what broke him.”"
  },
  "legacy/09-02": {
    "id": "legacy/09-02",
    "code": "09-02",
    "marker": "continue",
    "front": "MISSION BRIEFING\n\n“There is a final MEDUSA trial, by far the most severe strain they have created.\n\nThe trial is to take place in North America, and...you must prevent all of the trials. The PEARL Compound is their source for MEDUSA, so you may be able to find their loading dock and replace their samples with a placebo.\n\nThere is an extreme risk of exposure to the pathogen if you do this, but there may not be another way.\n\nYour final objective is to bug another control center. I recognize that it may be a lower priority, but intercepting Soviet data remains important.”",
    "back": "",
    "frontFlavor": "“There is a final MEDUSA trial, by far the most severe strain they have created.\n\nThe trial is to take place in North America, and...you must prevent all of the trials. The PEARL Compound is their source for MEDUSA, so you may be able to find their loading dock and replace their samples with a placebo.\n\nThere is an extreme risk of exposure to the pathogen if you do this, but there may not be another way.\n\nYour final objective is to bug another control center. I recognize that it may be a lower priority, but intercepting Soviet data remains important.”",
    "backFlavor": ""
  },
