    "back": "SEPTEMBER OBJECTIVE 1\n\nDISRUPT OR PREVENT ALL TRIALS\n\nDisrupt Trial in:\nALL KNOWN TRIAL CITIES IN NORTH AMERICA AT THE SAME TIME (OR PREVENT THEM FROM HAPPENING)\n\nCompleted: Read Debrief 230\nFailed: Read Debrief 178",
