    "back": "NOVEMBER OBJECTIVE 2\nBRIBE SABIK'S ALLY\n\nAcquire Target in:\n1 UNKNOWN ALLIED CITY\nYOU MAY NOT USE THE IDENTIFY TARGET CITY ACTION\n\nCompleted: Read Debrief 201\nFailed: Read Debrief 134",
