    "marker": "continue",
    "front": "MISSION BRIEFING\n\"With Sabik gone, our focus can shift entirely to MEDUSA and the Soviets. We are close to understanding how the plague will be dispersed; Soviets are calling it Operation LION'S TOOTH, but we need more than just a name. A Soviet spy posing as a businessman, last seen in Sydney, has this information.\nIn addition, you must dig deeper into PEARL compound; locate and sabotage the MEDUSA manufacturing equipment.\"\nOpen the following doors:\nU 39 42 S",
