  "legacy/sealed-12-02": {
    "id": "legacy/sealed-12-02",
    "code": "12-02",
    "marker": "continue",
    "front": "MISSION BRIEFING\n\"The time has come. You must steal the MEDUSA genome from PEARL. Without it, they cannot create more of the plague.\nAdditionally, Operation LION'S TOOTH is about to commence; one of their control centers is launching weather balloons containing pollen coated in the MEDUSA plague. Find out which control center it is, and stop it at all costs.\nThere will be only one chance to succeed at this.\"",
    "back": "SABIK'S BRIEFING\n\"Prioritize MEDUSA and LION'S TOOTH, no question, but if you can manage it, I have a favor to ask.\nYou saw what the Soviets did to me. John Cooper, your good buddy Coop, called off the extraction when I was caught. He let them turn me into a monster, and I just found out he's not dead.\nThe CIA has him in protective custody. Either they were worried that I might catch up with him, or they were trying to blame me for his death so that you wouldn't trust me.\nSo I'm asking: can you...can you bring him to me? I don't want to hurt him or anything, I just...I really need to see him. I need him to know what he did to me.\"",
    "frontFlavor": "\"The time has come. You must steal the MEDUSA genome from PEARL. Without it, they cannot create more of the plague.\nAdditionally, Operation LION'S TOOTH is about to commence; one of their control centers is launching weather balloons containing pollen coated in the MEDUSA plague. Find out which control center it is, and stop it at all costs.\nThere will be only one chance to succeed at this.\"",
    "backFlavor": "\"Prioritize MEDUSA and LION'S TOOTH, no question, but if you can manage it, I have a favor to ask.\nYou saw what the Soviets did to me. John Cooper, your good buddy Coop, called off the extraction when I was caught. He let them turn me into a monster, and I just found out he's not dead.\nThe CIA has him in protective custody. Either they were worried that I might catch up with him, or they were trying to blame me for his death so that you wouldn't trust me.\nSo I'm asking: can you...can you bring him to me? I don't want to hurt him or anything, I just...I really need to see him. I need him to know what he did to me.\""
  },
