    "fullText": "The bug picked up a hushed discussion between Soviet workers, who were recently at a compound in Siberia. They discussed secret rooms filled with vegetation, gardeners wearing chemical suits, and screams behind closed doors.\n\nPlace a Control Center sticker on the target city. Place a Bug sticker over the corner of the Control Center sticker to show that it was bugged. Take the target City card under the objective and add it to the hand of the player who completed this objective."
