    "flavor": "CIA Evaluation (Dec. 1962). Expectations exceeded. Encountered mild difficulty with certain objectives but overall a highly commendable performance. Recommendation: retain as field agents for high priority missions.",
    "rules": "CIA Evaluation (Dec. 1962). Expectations exceeded. Encountered mild difficulty with certain objectives but overall a highly commendable performance. Recommendation: retain as field agents for high priority missions.",
